# .env.example
#
# Sample machine-wide overrides for the local RAG system. Defaults live in
# .env.default; this file only shows what you can change and why you might
# want to.
#
# To use it:
#   cp .env.example .env
# then uncomment the lines you want. Anything you leave commented keeps its
# value from .env.default. Never commit .env.
#
# Models, chunking, retrieval, and paths are per-store settings and are
# ignored here. Change them in stores/<name>/store.toml (see
# stores/defaults.toml), or override one for a single run from the shell:
#   LLM_MODEL=qwen3:4b python -m src.app

# --- Switch to another data store --------------------------------------------
# The name of a folder under stores/ that has a store.toml.
# RAG_STORE=research

# --- Use Ollama running on another machine -----------------------------------
# On that machine, start Ollama with OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0 so it accepts
# connections from the network.
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://192.168.1.50:11434
